<LegalLayout title="About — ImgFeel" description="About ImgFeel. Learn about our free, privacy-first image tools." canonicalUrl="https://imgfeel.com/about/">
  <h1>About ImgFeel</h1>

  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>ImgFeel provides fast, free, and private image tools that work entirely in your browser. We believe image processing should be simple, accessible, and respect your privacy.</p>

  <h2>Privacy First</h2>
  <p>Every ImgFeel tool processes images directly on your device. Your images are never uploaded to a server. They never leave your browser. When you close the tab, they're gone. This is privacy by design, not just a promise.</p>

  <h2>How It Works</h2>
  <p>ImgFeel uses modern web technologies like the Canvas API and Web APIs to process images directly in your browser. This means instant results without waiting for server uploads, and complete privacy since your data never travels over the internet.</p>

  <h2>Free and Open</h2>
  <p>ImgFeel is completely free to use. No accounts, no subscriptions, no watermarks, no hidden fees. We believe basic image tools should be accessible to everyone.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Have feedback, suggestions, or questions? Reach out at <a href="mailto:contact@imgfeel.com">contact@imgfeel.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
